Enhanced variant of mesh.frag (cmake/ShaderVariant.cmake: each find text
must occur exactly once): enhanced_shadow.glsl in place of shadow.glsl, the
GTAO on the ambient (the sky through the lightmap, the hemi map's colour),
the cascades in place of the SimpleShadowmap where they reach.
